msgid ""
"It is based on the filter equations derived `here "
"<https://github.com/priseborough/InertialNav/blob/master/derivations/RotationVectorAttitudeParameterisation/GenerateNavFilterEquations.m>`__."
msgstr ""
"该滤波器基于 `此处 "
