#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:26
#: 8be53ec468304eaf8fe4b6532aaf9f6a
msgid "EKF2 Advantages"
msgstr "EKF2 的优势"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:28
#: 20e7b5f55b2a441984b8ce44051705c8
msgid ""
"It can run a separate EKF2 for each IMU making recovery from an IMU fault "
"much more likely"
msgstr "可为每个 IMU 单独运行一个 EKF2，大大提高了从 IMU 故障中恢复的可能性"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:29
#: 55e24591a1ca421880317bcd2f583697
msgid "It can switch between magnetometers if there is fault"
msgstr "可在磁力计发生故障时进行切换"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:30
#: 76a22053ce654278a1ca81940e368e1b
msgid ""
"It can estimate gyro scale factors which can improve accuracy during high "
"rate manoeuvres."
msgstr "可估计陀螺仪比例因子，从而提高高速率机动时的精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:31
#: 6c975968d1a24f5497720451145894e9
msgid ""
"It can simultaneously estimate both gyro offsets and orientation on startup "
"whilst moving and doesn't rely on the DCM algorithm for its initial "
"orientation. This makes it ideal for flying from moving platforms when the "
"gyro has not been calibrated."
msgstr "可在运动过程中同时估计陀螺仪偏置和初始方向，不依赖 DCM 算法的初始定向。这使其非常适合在陀螺仪未经校准的运动平台上起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:32
#: 8a3b1adbfb9c41b5858d710ef58f4126
msgid "It can handle larger gyro bias changes in flight"
msgstr "可处理飞行中更大的陀螺仪偏置变化"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:33
#: 1566d897c2d144cab6bd3b4741736d68
msgid "It is able to recover faster from bad sensor data"
msgstr "能够更快地从异常传感器数据中恢复"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:34
#: 2305c1fd2c324c5f9e0a69ed2c8cab24
msgid "It provides a slightly smoother output."
msgstr "输出更加平滑。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:35
#: bdecb1e4dbfc4ed5ac000ae60f56a7e4
msgid "It is slightly more accurate"
msgstr "精度略有提升"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:36
#: f0903e45cb8042f9995f6ae13751ec9d
msgid "It uses slightly less computing power"
msgstr "计算资源消耗略少"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:37
#: 007b83a37af64346b365b3f51d099159
msgid ""
"It starts using GPS when checks pass rather than waiting for the vehicle "
"motors to arm."
msgstr "在 GPS 检查通过后立即开始使用 GPS，而不必等待载具电机解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:41
#: 445575b8dae54189917f718dd20a5775
msgid "How does it achieve this?"
msgstr "它是如何实现的？"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:43
#: 62888b7fc3af4f65ac742aa36664bf8e
msgid ""
"Instead of trying to estimate the quaternion orientation directly, it "
"estimates an error rotation vector and applies the correction to the "
"quaternion from the inertial navigation equations. This is better when there"
" are large angle errors as it avoids errors associated with linearising "
"quaternions across large angle changes."
msgstr ""
"它不直接估计四元数姿态，而是估计误差旋转向量，并将修正量应用到惯性导航方程的四元数上。当存在大角度误差时，这种方法更优，因为它避免了在大角度变化时对四元数线性化所带来的误差。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:49
#: 25c5570e9a6345349c372c1ba2a72d44
msgid ""
"See \"Rotation Vector in Attitude Estimation\", Mark E. Pittelkau, Journal "
"of Guidance, Control, and Dynamics, 2003” for details on this approach."
msgstr ""
"详见 Mark E. Pittelkau 于 2003 年在《Journal of Guidance, Control, and "
"Dynamics》发表的「Rotation Vector in Attitude Estimation」一文。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:53
#: 544830a9f51648c8a46182dbb7134f6b
msgid ""
"The new EKF runs on a delayed time horizon so that when measurements are "
"fused, they are done so using the measurement, filter states and covariance "
"matrix from the same point in time. The legacy EKF uses a simpler method "
"where delayed measurements are fused using delayed states but the covariance"
" matrix is from the current time which reduces accuracy."
msgstr ""
"新 EKF 在延迟的时间范围内运行，因此融合测量时使用的是同一时间点的测量值、滤波器状态和协方差矩阵。传统 EKF "
"采用较简单的方式，使用延迟状态融合延迟测量，但协方差矩阵来自当前时刻，这会降低精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:60
#: b49c581a93dd476d8e4237c926f7325b
msgid ""
"The delayed filter states are then predicted forward into the current time "
"horizon using a complementary filter that removes the time delay and also "
"filters out the sudden changes in the states that occur when measurements "
"are fused."
msgstr "随后，延迟的滤波器状态通过互补滤波器向前预测至当前时刻，消除时间延迟，并滤除融合测量时状态的突变。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:64
#: 5ed184a5bee94999a2b1e45803cc3184
msgid ""
"This approach was inspired by the output predictor work done by Ali "
"Khosravian from ANU. \"Recursive Attitude Estimation in the Presence of "
"Multi-rate and Multi-delay Vector Measurements,” A Khosravian, J Trumpf, R "
"Mahony, T Hamel - American Control Conference, vol.-, 2015."
msgstr ""
"该方法受到澳大利亚国立大学 Ali Khosravian 输出预测器工作的启发。「Recursive Attitude Estimation in "
"the Presence of Multi-rate and Multi-delay Vector Measurements」，A "
"Khosravian、J Trumpf、R Mahony、T Hamel，美国控制会议，第 - 卷，2015 年。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:69
#: 88aa56fd36bc4ff798c5036a7aa6dc76
msgid ""
"This is computationally much cheaper than winding the states forward using "
"buffered IMU data at each update, but slightly less accurate. The legacy EKF"
" smooths the state corrections by applying them incrementally across the "
"time to the next measurement which reduces stability of the filter."
msgstr ""
"与在每次更新时使用缓冲的 IMU 数据向前推进状态相比，这种方法计算量少得多，但精度略低。传统 EKF "
"通过在到下一次测量的时间内逐步应用状态修正来平滑修正，这会降低滤波器的稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:75
#: e1dfad3a04b848f5b66f0e97df8a939e
msgid ""
"Further optimisation of mathematics and code to improve speed have been "
"introduced."
msgstr "已引入数学和代码的进一步优化以提升速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:77
#: 3d993c2e08a64eed866203c2c079fabd
msgid ""
"A simple compass yaw angle fusion method with fixed declination has been "
"added which is used on the ground or when magnetic interference prevents use"
" of the more accurate 3-axis 6-state magnetometer fusion technique."
msgstr "增加了一种固定磁偏角的简单罗盘偏航角融合方法，用于地面阶段或磁干扰导致无法使用更精确的三轴六状态磁力计融合技术时。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:83
#: d7b009f7e2e0417db1c03f10bb2bd0ca
msgid "Using EKF2"
msgstr "使用 EKF2"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:85
#: d3598941c8ce4108965827ccd7e327c7
msgid ""
"Enable the new EKF by setting EK2_ENABLE = 1.  EKF2 will now be running in "
"parallel and logging, etc but it will not be used by the control loops."
msgstr "通过设置 EK2_ENABLE = 1 启用新 EKF。EKF2 此时将并行运行并记录日志，但不会用于飞行控制回路。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:88
#: fe97086318364a75bb007f0a9841fce0
