msgid "Filter Innovations"
msgstr "滤波器新息"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:184
#: dd5f5740312f41b8944430ad99b8105a
msgid ""
"**NKF3[0]** (and **NKF3[1]** if a second IMU is being used) contain "
"information on the filter innovations. An innovation is the difference "
"between the measurement value predicted byEKF2 and the value returned by the"
" sensor. Smaller innovations indicate smaller sensor errors. Because the IMU"
" data is used to do the prediction, bad IMU data can result in large "
"innovations for all measurements."
msgstr ""
"**NKF3[0]** （如果使用第二个 IMU，则还有 **NKF3[1]**）包含滤波器新息信息。新息是 EKF2 "
"预测的测量值与传感器返回的实际值之差。新息越小，传感器误差越小。由于 IMU 数据用于预测，异常的 IMU 数据可能导致所有测量的新息都偏大。"

