msgid "**EK2_ENABLE**"
msgstr "**EK2_ENABLE**"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:306
#: 6241e25b56704b759e61f3ccefee4daa
msgid ""
"This turns the EKF 2 on and off. Set to 1 to turn on and 0 to turn off. "
"Turning EKF2 on only makes the calculations run, it does not mean it will be"
" used for flight control. To use it for flight control set AHRS_EKF_TYPE=2. "
"A reboot or restart will need to be performed after changing the value of "
"EK2_ENABLE for it to take effect."
msgstr ""
"此参数用于打开或关闭 EKF2。设为 1 打开，设为 0 关闭。打开 EKF2 仅使其运算，并不意味着它会被用于飞行控制。若要在飞行控制中使用，需设置 "
"AHRS_EKF_TYPE=2。更改 EK2_ENABLE 值后需重启方可生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf2-estimation-system.rst:312
